{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"中非共和国","country_iso":"CAF","created_at":"2026-04-10T08:56:50.870655","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"CAF-PV-0003","ldc":"Yes","location":"班吉市","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"中非班吉市15兆瓦光伏电站项目","project_name_en":"Central Africa Bangui 15MW Solar PV Project","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"天津电建","content":"近日，\n天津电建\n中标\n中非光伏电站援建总承包项目\n，承包方式为设计—采购—施工（\nEPC\n），项目业主为中华人民共和国商务部。\n根据中华人民共和国政府和中非政府 2019 年 8 月 7 日签订的立项换文规定，中国政府将援助中非共和国在其首都班吉市建设一座光伏电站。项目包括新建15兆瓦太阳能光伏电站1座，新建63千伏升压站1座，5兆瓦时储能系统1套，以及配套输变电线路。该项目计划2020年10月底开工。","content_sha256":"6bdebebd69fc1852dc8f0554d6c8e8b0c83750f59e56864eabfd2d38163f65d8","id":21102,"publish_date":"2020-06-17 13:12:17","title":"天津电建中标中非光伏援建总承包项目","title_sha256":"31dcdeaab1f6f6de2f2ee723a802c607508474cde21e1435a56d66cf501b8a07","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/14646.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"CAF-PV-0003","capacity_details":"PV: 15MW","capacity_mw":15.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"15","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-04-10T08:56:50.878192","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"CAF-PV-0003-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"http://www.scio.gov.cn/gxzl/ydyl_26587/jmwl_26592/jmwl_26593/202510/t20251028_936866.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"2020-10-01","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"中华人民共和国商务部","project_developer_en":"Ministry of Commerce of the People's Republic of China","project_stage":"中标","project_summary":"天津电建中标中非共和国班吉市光伏电站援建总承包项目，该项目将建设一座15兆瓦的太阳能光伏电站及配套设施，目前处于中标阶段。","publish_date":"2020-06-17 13:12:17","pv_capacity_mw":15.0,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/14646.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":5.0,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}},{"articles":[{"author":"","content":"非班吉市郊光伏电站项目可行性考察会谈纪要签署仪式在中非能源与水利部举行。\n驻中非大使陈栋与中非能源水利部长乔诺签署纪要，经商处负责人王晖一秘和能源水利部办公厅主任出席。\n乔衷心感谢中国政府长期以来对中非的无私帮助，表示签署会谈纪要是启动光伏项目的关键一步，希望项目尽快实施，缓解班吉市用电紧张，造福中非百姓。陈大使表示，中国同中非传统友好，中方愿同中非方一道，积极推进落实中非合作论坛北京峰会成果，以及两国元首达成的共识，推动项目取得进展，用实际行动支持中非各方近日在喀土穆签署的和平协议，助力中非国家重建。同时，陈大使表示，两国经济技术合作将随着中非和平协议的不断落实以及安全形势的不断好转也将会进一步深化，并向中非内地扩展，旨在更广泛地造福中非民众。\n签署仪式结束后，陈大使接受当地媒体采访。","content_sha256":"7645f6fec32b0ebebb40b2c023419f307f8fdb2489bf3f3c17ad89386e69cd9e","id":24050,"publish_date":"2019-04-09 14:30:17","title":"中国—中非两国签署班吉光伏电站项目考察纪要","title_sha256":"d96f624ba49ddf1786bf5e937563ef98870201e336b98b4674cbd26844df589c","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/8679.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"CAF-PV-0003","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-04-10T09:17:29.781262","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"CAF-PV-0003-02","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://cf.china-embassy.gov.cn/xwdt/201908/t20190814_7169182.htm\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"","project_developer_en":null,"project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"中国与中非共和国在中非能源与水利部签署了班吉光伏电站项目考察纪要。该项目旨在缓解班吉市用电紧张，由中国驻中非大使陈栋与中非能源水利部长乔诺签署纪要，标志着项目启动的关键一步，具体装机容量和参与企业细节未在文中披露。","publish_date":"2019-04-09 14:30:17"